    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90234.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 25,
    "turn_text": "I'm curious, you did mention race and I just have one question. I'm sure you get it. I opened up that. I don't want to ask the stupid, I was going to ask what is the dumbest question you've heard, but I'm sure it's race related. I just want to ask what it's been like being on the Congressional Black Caucus. You made the case during the campaign that you wanted to work from inside it rather than just reject it. And I'm curious, how's that gone? A year in, what's it been like?",
